      "possibly_sensitive": false,
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 22,
        "impression_count": 44456,
        "like_count": 310,
        "quote_count": 4,
        "reply_count": 23,
        "retweet_count": 32
      },
      "text": "The degree of future acceleration in AI right now is bonkers\n\nOne day in AI feels like a week in “normal business time”\n\nThese relativistic effects mean that some companies will accomplish what would normally take 3 yrs in 1 yr\n\nAnd unfortunately, many others will be left behind",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1623039053884162048"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "conversation_id": "1622760302516355072",
      "created_at": "2023-02-07T00:53:00.000Z",
      "display_text_range": [
        0,
        288
      ],
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1622760302516355072"
      ],
      "id": "1622760302516355072",
      "lang": "en",
      "possibly_sensitive": false,
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 56,
        "impression_count": 37544,
        "like_count": 207,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 9,
        "retweet_count": 29
      },
      "text": "RLHF is the \"UI/interface design\" of LLMs &amp; genAI.\n\nIt is how we will _design_ the interactions between users &amp; the model, and program it to mirror the desired behavior—helpful, playful, creative, factual\n\nLike design, it will be a fundamental way to differentiate in the next era",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1622760302516355072"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "conversation_id": "1622336208138571776",
      "created_at": "2023-02-05T20:47:48.000Z",
      "display_text_range": [
        0,
        284
      ],
