        "1622336208138571776"
      ],
      "id": "1622336208138571776",
      "lang": "en",
      "possibly_sensitive": false,
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 121,
        "impression_count": 82407,
        "like_count": 475,
        "quote_count": 3,
        "reply_count": 23,
        "retweet_count": 56
      },
      "text": "toughest questions right now in AI are\n\n- is it a feature or a product?\n- is it a fad/novelty or a repeat use case?\n\nhint: if your retention sucks, it might just be a fad or novelty\n\nhint: if an incumbent can easily integrate it, &amp; the best most is “model quality”, it’s a feature",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1622336208138571776"
    },
