        "text": "The recent news around Google Bard's incorrect fact in the ad points to 2 increasingly critical parts of the nascent LLM stack:\n\n- LLM Expert Verification—experts in the loop constantly fact-checking LLMs\n- RLHF—encourage the model to bullshit less, and rely more on exact facts"
